Sea-water cooling system of one main engine shall be provided with two pumps, one of which shall be a stand-by pump. The capacity of the stand-by pump shall not be less than that of the main pump. At least one of the pumps shall have independent drive. It is admissible to apply one common, independently driven stand -by pump for both sea and fresh water.", "topic": "冷却水泵冗余配置", "source_document": "S44 PRS Ship Machinery Piping Systems", "source_type": "ship_rule", "location": "P197", "evidence_strength": "direct", "is_generalizable": "limited", "applicability_level": "class_rule", "manufacturer": "", "engine_model": "", "system_type": ["LT cooling water loop", "sea water side", "fresh water side"], "component_objects": ["cooling_water_pump"], "requirement_intents": ["redundancy", "capacity", "reliability"], "engineering_phase": ["basic_design", "detailed_design", "class_approval", "procurement"], "applicable_condition": ["normal_operation"], "can_support": ["parameter_limit", "equipment_selection", "calculation", "class_review"], "limitation": "适用范围以规则、规范或标准条文本身及项目入级要求为准。", "normalized_summary": "原文说明了参数来源、设计依据或相关设备关系，但没有给出可直接采用的具体数值。它适合支撑参数确认路径，而不是直接替代技术数据或计算书。", "supportable_requirements": ["cooling_water_pump 的 redundancy", "capacity 参数应依据来源文件", "厂家技术数据或项目计算文件确定。", "若原文给出明确限值", "可作为对应适用对象和工况下的参数约束。"], "unsupported_requirements": "1. 不能直接给出可用于设计输入的具体数值。\n2. 不能超出来源文件限定的厂家、机型、系统型式或工况范围泛化。\n3. 不能直接支撑施工安装、冲洗试压或图纸送审完整性要求。", "constraint": {"规范依据": "11.1.2", "强制级别": "强制", "约束类型": "redundancy", "适用对象": "海水冷却系统", "核心要求": "每台主机的海水冷却系统应配备两台泵，其中一台为备用泵，备用泵的容量不应小于主泵的容量，且至少一台泵应具有独立驱动。", "可接受标准": "2台泵，备用泵容量≥主泵容量", "验证方式": "设计审查", "关联条文": []}, "_context_status": "partial_unknown", "_omitted_metadata_fields": [], "_missing_applicability_fields": ["engine_model"], "_extracted_values": [], "_omitted_parameter_records": 0, "_extraction_status": "unknown_historical", "_semantic_support": "unknown", "_applicability": "unknown", "_text_truncated": true, "_fragment_fallback": true, "_fragm